# cargo
# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed (see AGENTS.md "Build
# Reproducibility"): the reproducible-build CI gate runs
# `cargo update --locked`, which fails on a fresh checkout without it.
# axum-mux is a member of the root workspace, so its nested lock is an
# orphaned artifact superseded by the root Cargo.lock — ignore it.
axum-mux/Cargo.lock

